>  <SOURCE_REFERENCES>
["https://github.com/jensengroup/xyz2mol_tm/tree/db2734b084045ef895528c7a3d5040d38da23983/SMILES_csvs","https://github.com/uiocompcat/tmQM/tree/ece824419c9006fe66436daf233822b75533b82f/tmQM"]

>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Site-by-site g-xTB review of the preferred resonance form. Chose a localized Lewis representation for delocalized electrons within the same ligand. Localized 18 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths.

